{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01N834KBEWUjZSUHfgzjDBhU","type":"tool_result","content":"# Canary Deployment Strategy - Verbatim Reproduction\n\n**Introductory Prose:**\n\"A canary rollout is a deployment strategy where the operator releases a new version of their application to a small percentage of the production traffic.\"\n\n**Sentences containing \"header-based\" or \"traffic routing\":**\n1. \"You wish to scale the canary stack up minimally, and use some header based traffic shaping to the canary, while setWeight is still set to 0.\"\n\n2. \"The traffic management rules to apply to control the flow of traffic between the active and canary versions. If not set, the default weighted pod replica based routing will be used.\"\n\n**Finding on \"A/B\":**\nThe string \"A/B\" does **not** appear on this page."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4b4f5a06-4bc3-4221-b900-b8461cc3e79d","uuid":"cae9f8e0-f66d-4755-9acb-0c767e945f84","timestamp":"2026-08-31T10:05:15.125Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":13811,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Canary Deployment Strategy - Verbatim Reproduction\n\n**Introductory Prose:**\n\"A canary rollout is a deployment strategy where the operator releases a new version of their application to a small percentage of the production traffic.\"\n\n**Sentences containing \"header-based\" or \"traffic routing\":**\n1. \"You wish to scale the canary stack up minimally, and use some header based traffic shaping to the canary, while setWeight is still set to 0.\"\n\n2. \"The traffic management rules to apply to control the flow of traffic between the active and canary versions. If not set, the default weighted pod replica based routing will be used.\"\n\n**Finding on \"A/B\":**\nThe string \"A/B\" does **not** appear on this page.","durationMs":2811,"url":"https://argo-rollouts.readthedocs.io/en/stable/features/canary/"}}
