{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01R29fgutyUQNpBSCchEvCnc","type":"tool_result","content":"Based on the OpenGitOps glossary provided:\n\n**GitOps** - ABSENT\n\n**Software Agent** - ABSENT\n\n**Desired State** - \"The aggregate of all configuration data that is sufficient to recreate the system...\"\n\n**State Store** - \"A system for storing immutable versions of desired state declarations.\"\n\n**State Description** - ABSENT\n\n**Reconciliation** - \"The process of ensuring the actual state of a system matches its desired state.\"\n\n**Drift** - \"When a system's actual state has moved or is in the process of moving away from the desired state...\"\n\n**Continuous Deployment** - ABSENT\n\n**GitOps Managed Software System** - ABSENT\n\n**Rollback** - ABSENT (though mentioned contextually in the Feedback definition)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4b4f5a06-4bc3-4221-b900-b8461cc3e79d","uuid":"1899efdd-9b77-41c7-bb25-25d39cdce4cc","timestamp":"2026-08-31T10:06:25.900Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":260461,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"Based on the OpenGitOps glossary provided:\n\n**GitOps** - ABSENT\n\n**Software Agent** - ABSENT\n\n**Desired State** - \"The aggregate of all configuration data that is sufficient to recreate the system...\"\n\n**State Store** - \"A system for storing immutable versions of desired state declarations.\"\n\n**State Description** - ABSENT\n\n**Reconciliation** - \"The process of ensuring the actual state of a system matches its desired state.\"\n\n**Drift** - \"When a system's actual state has moved or is in the process of moving away from the desired state...\"\n\n**Continuous Deployment** - ABSENT\n\n**GitOps Managed Software System** - ABSENT\n\n**Rollback** - ABSENT (though mentioned contextually in the Feedback definition)","durationMs":3219,"url":"https://github.com/open-gitops/documents/blob/main/GLOSSARY.md"}}
