{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011CB1PV4Fubt7mEaMJfFfcP","type":"tool_result","content":"# Clusters Section Summary\n\n**Storage of Credentials:**\n\"Cluster credentials are stored in secrets same as repositories or repository credentials. Each secret must have label `argocd.argoproj.io/secret-type: cluster`.\"\n\n**Example Secret:**\nThe documentation provides this cluster secret configuration:\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Secret\nmetadata:\n  name: mycluster-secret\n  labels:\n    argocd.argoproj.io/secret-type: cluster\ntype: Opaque\nstringData:\n  name: mycluster.example.com\n  server: https://mycluster.example.com\n  config: |\n    {\n      \"bearerToken\": \"<authentication token>\",\n      \"tlsClientConfig\": {\n        \"insecure\": false,\n        \"caData\": \"<base64 encoded certificate>\"\n      }\n    }\n```\n\n**Deployment Capability:**\nThe documentation states that applications can \"deploy into\" both external clusters and the local cluster where Argo CD runs, referenced as `https://kubernetes.default.svc`."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4b4f5a06-4bc3-4221-b900-b8461cc3e79d","uuid":"fa811f69-d6b8-4712-bc8f-7b8ae6a83aa5","timestamp":"2026-08-31T10:08:09.765Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":83589,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Clusters Section Summary\n\n**Storage of Credentials:**\n\"Cluster credentials are stored in secrets same as repositories or repository credentials. Each secret must have label `argocd.argoproj.io/secret-type: cluster`.\"\n\n**Example Secret:**\nThe documentation provides this cluster secret configuration:\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Secret\nmetadata:\n  name: mycluster-secret\n  labels:\n    argocd.argoproj.io/secret-type: cluster\ntype: Opaque\nstringData:\n  name: mycluster.example.com\n  server: https://mycluster.example.com\n  config: |\n    {\n      \"bearerToken\": \"<authentication token>\",\n      \"tlsClientConfig\": {\n        \"insecure\": false,\n        \"caData\": \"<base64 encoded certificate>\"\n      }\n    }\n```\n\n**Deployment Capability:**\nThe documentation states that applications can \"deploy into\" both external clusters and the local cluster where Argo CD runs, referenced as `https://kubernetes.default.svc`.","durationMs":3732,"url":"https://argo-cd.readthedocs.io/en/stable/operator-manual/declarative-setup/"}}
