{"type":"stream_event","event":{"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":".\"\n\n## Problem it addresses\n\"No matter how thorough the testing strategy, there are always some bugs discovered in production. Shifting 100% of traffic from one version of an app to another can lead to more impactful failures.\"\n\n## How it helps\n\"Canary"}},"session_id":"4b4f5a06-4bc3-4221-b900-b8461cc3e79d","parent_tool_use_id":null,"uuid":"a30394a5-2abe-458d-8e24-153eeac10475"}
